okout and a safe distance while driving just like everyone else on the road.</div><a id="link_button-261-61" class="ct-link-button" href="/practice-areas/motorcycle-accidents/"   >Motorcycle Accidents</a></div></div><div id="div_block-262-61" class="ct-div-block" ><div id="div_block-263-61" class="ct-div-block" ><div id="text_block-264-61" class="ct-text-block" >OUR MISSION IS TO COLLECT THE BEST POSSIBLE AWARD</div><h2 id="headline-265-61" class="ct-headline">PERSONAL INJURY</h2><div id="text_block-266-61" class="ct-text-block" >Our mission at the Law Office of Riedmiller, Andersen &amp; Scott, LLC, is to help you in these cases so you collect a just award.</div><a id="link_button-267-61" class="ct-link-button" href="/practice-areas/personal-injury/"   >Personal Injury Claims</a></div><img  id="image-268-61" alt="a doctor taking care of patient" data-src="https://www.lawyerontheline.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/hp-sec3-img-3.png" class="ct-image img-absolute lazyload" data-srcset="https://www.lawyerontheline.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/hp-sec3-img-3.png 797w, https://www.lawyerontheline.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/hp-sec3-img-3-300x235.png 300w, https://www.lawyerontheline.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/hp-sec3-img-3-768x600.png 768w" data-sizes="(max-width: 797px) 100vw, 797px" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" style="--smush-placeholder-width: 797px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 797/623;" /></div></div><a id="link_button-147-61" class="ct-link-button" href="/practice-areas/"   >View All Practice  Areas</a></div></div></section><section id="section-149-61" class=" ct-section" ><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="div_block-150-61" class="ct-div-block" ><div id="div_block-151-61" class="ct-div-block" ><h2 id="headline-153-61" class="ct-headline">Meet our lawyers</h2><img  id="image-155-61" alt="icon" data-src="https://www.lawyerontheline.com/wp-content/upl